@startuml SequenceDiagram_ForgotPassword
' Sequence Diagram - Forgot Password (UC9) through Reset Password (UC10)
' Plain black-and-white style matching the report's existing sequence
' diagrams (e.g. Manage Users). Covers the full round trip: request the
' link, the emailed link, then setting the new password.

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
hide footbox

skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor black
  LifeLineBorderColor black
  LifeLineBackgroundColor white
  ParticipantBorderColor black
  ParticipantBackgroundColor white
  ParticipantFontColor black
  ParticipantFontStyle bold
}

participant "Cafe Admin" as Admin
participant "Flask Server" as Flask
participant "SQLite DB" as DB
participant "Gmail SMTP" as Mail

Admin -> Flask : 1: Request Forgot Password page
Flask --> Admin : 2: Display Admin ID form
Admin -> Flask : 3: Submit Admin ID
Flask -> DB : 4: Look up admin (active, email on file);\ncreate reset token (30-min expiry)
DB --> Flask : 5: Token stored
Flask -> Mail : 6: Send reset link email
Mail --> Flask : 7: Email accepted
Flask --> Admin : 8: Show confirmation message

== Admin opens the emailed reset link ==

Admin -> Flask : 9: Open reset link; submit new password
Flask -> DB : 10: Validate token (unused, not expired);\nupdate password_hash; mark token used
DB --> Flask : 11: Confirm update
Flask --> Admin : 12: Password updated; redirect to login

@enduml
